'''Ghostfreak''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurite]]<ref>[[Zs'Skayr]]</ref><ref name="GO"/> from the planet [[Anur Phaetos]] in the [[Anur System]].{{Refn|[[:File:Ghostfreak Bandai Lenticular Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = card}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Ghostfreak===
Ghostfreak is a phantom/[[Wikipedia:Ghost|ghost]]-like alien with a gaseous appearance and claw-like hands, and grey skin with black lines running all over him. His skin is removable with black and white striped tentacles underneath it.

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Ghostfreak's [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol peeked out of his skin on his lower left chest, and he had a pink eye with a black pupil.

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''', Ghostfreak looked exactly like [[Zs'Skayr]] did in the same series, including a purple body, except his eye was green and the original Omnitrix symbol was on his chest.

In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ghostfreak looked like the [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurite]] designs seen in ''[[Ghost Town]]'', except his eye was green. Ghostfreak wore the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest. In the '''Ultimate Alien''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|opening]], the line patterns on his body were different.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Ghostfreak now has dark green chains all over his front side which lead to his neck, waist, and center/chest. The spikes on his elbows have returned, his skin is now peppermint-colored, and he has two cuffs on each of his arms. The [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is located at the center of his chains. When possessing someone, he has a green glow. His tentacles are now black and purple-striped, and his eye is colored green.

===Bad Ben as Bad Ghostfreak===
[[Bad Ben]]'s Ghostfreak looks similar to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s Ghostfreak in '''Omniverse''', except the green parts of Bad Ben's version's body are colored mint green and his chains are colored peacock blue.
