{{Quote|But you know what they say- possession is nine-tenths of the law.|Ghostfreak to [[Michael Morningstar (Classic)|Darkstar]].<ref name="MI" />}}
By manipulating his protoplasm,<ref>[[Kraab (Classic)|Kraab]]</ref><ref name="Hunted" /> Ghostfreak can make himself intangible and invisible as both a powerful defense and a way of infiltrating high-security locations.<ref name="K11">''[[Kevin 11 (Episode)|Kevin 11]]''</ref> As an extended technique, Ghostfreak can choose to selectively make parts of himself corporeal or slightly corporeal to still interact with the world or fight, the most deadly example of which being when Ghostfreak passed into [[Thumbskull (Classic)|Thumbskull]]'s body and incapacitated him without a chance to fight back.<ref name="GO"/> An additional effect of Ghostfreak's intangibility is that he can make those he passes through suddenly feel deathly cold.<ref name="Hunted" /> Ghostfreak is also capable of making other objects or people intangible and transparent through physical contact;<ref name="MI" /> first demonstrated by [[Zs'Skayr]].<ref name="BAotD" /> Additionally, Ghostfreak is able to disrupt electronics by phasing through them, as also demonstrated by Zs'Skayr.<ref name="RMP">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref>

By flying into them while intangible, Ghostfreak is able to possess the bodies of his enemies and control their movements, to the point where he can cause them to fly around like himself, and can even stop possessing them midair to let them slam into walls.<ref name="GO"/><ref name="BAotD" /> He can also access the abilities of other beings that possess superpowers.<ref name="MI" /> Additionally, Ghostfreak can completely erase someone's consciousness while possessing them if his willpower is strong enough, as demonstrated by Zs'Skayr.<ref name="RMP" />

Ghostfreak can possess [[Florauna (Classic)|Florauna]],{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = Florauna}}<ref name="BAotD" /> [[Vladat]]s,{{Refn|[[:File:Ectonurites Can Possess Vladats.png]]|group = DJW}}<ref name="TVSB">''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]''</ref> [[Transylian]]s,<ref name="BAotD" /> [[Necrofriggian (Classic)|Necrofriggian]]s,{{refn|[[:File:Big Chill Possessed By Ectonurites.png]]|group = DJW}} [[Atrocian]]s, [[Polymorph (Classic)|Polymorph]]s,{{Refn|[[:File:Ectonurites Can Possess Atrocians & Polymorphs.png]]|group = DJW}} [[Galvanic Mechamorph (Classic)|Galvanic Mechamorphs]], [[Microchip]]s, [[Chronosapien]]s,{{Refn|[[:File:Tech Beings Can Be Possessed and Have Life Absorbed.png]]|group = DJW}} [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]]s{{Refn|[[:File:Celestialsapiens Can Be Possessed.PNG]]|group = DJW}}, [[Atomix's Species]]{{Refn|[[:File:Tech Beings Can Be Possessed and Have Life Absorbed 2.png]]|group = DJW|name = Atomix}} and even other Ectonurites{{Refn|[[:File:Ectonurites Can Possess Each Other.png]]|group = DJW|name = possession}}. Essentially, any species that possesses sentience and [[Manna|life force]], Ghostfreak is capable of possessing.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = Atomix}}

Ghostfreak can expose tentacles from his chest, either by drawing back his outermost layer of skin or bursting them through his skin.<ref name="ATTWN">''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref><ref name="AND" />  These prehensile tentacles are very useful for grabbing objects<ref name="GO" /><ref name="BiM">''[[Bengeance is Mine]]''</ref> and/or coiling around people or objects;<ref name="AND" /> stabbing;<ref name="ATTWN" /> and generally increasing his scare factor.<ref name="LL" />

Ghostfreak is capable of telekinesis, shown off by Zs'Skayr while he was still in the Omnitrix, when he used his telekinesis to make flames erupt from Bunsen burners.<ref name="GO" /> Ghostfreak is also capable of telepathy.{{Refn|[[:File:Ghostfreak Cereal Card.png]]|group = CN|name = tele}}

Ghostfreak can regenerate lost skin if needed, as demonstrated by Zs'Skayr when he was in control of Ghostfreak's body.<ref name="GT" />

Ghostfreak is capable of flight and levitation, which he can use to soar through the air at high speeds.<ref name="CS">''[[Charm School]]''</ref><ref name="BiM" />

Ghostfreak has sharp claws, which can easily tear through [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Mechadroid|Mechadroids]].<ref name="Malgax Attacks">''[[Malgax Attacks]]''</ref>

Ghostfreak possesses enhanced strength, as shown when he lifted a large wrestling mat with [[Acid Breath (Classic)|Acid Breath]] on top<ref name="GO" /> and used his tentacles to grab a bus full of people.<ref name="BiM" />

Ghostfreak has enhanced durability, as he was able to withstand punches from [[Kraab (Classic)|Kraab]] and Vilgax (using the [[Shield of Seagle]]), both which threw him against a wall.<ref name="Hunted" /><ref name="GT" />

Ghostfreak can survive in the vacuum of space, as demonstrated by Zs'Skayr.<ref name="BAotD" /> 

Ghostfreak is immune to having his [[manna]] absorbed by energy absorbing opponents, such as [[Michael Morningstar (Classic)|Michael Morningstar]]. This is because Ectonurites do not have manna, as they are not alive in the same conventional way that most other life forms are.<ref name="MI" />{{Refn|[[:File:Ectonurite Life.png]]|name = Derrick|group = DJW}}

Unlike all other Ectonurites, Ghostfreak is immune to sunlight due to the help of the Omnitrix.<ref name="GO" />{{Refn|This page was created on August 11, 2007, by a user named [[User:Ghostfreak|Ghostfreak]]. This earliest revision made indirect mention of [[Zs'Skayr]]'s form being "sun-weakened" and without "protective skin". Thus, [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurites]] had been, for the longest time, portrayed on the wiki as only weak to sunlight when without their outermost layer of skin. However, both pop-up trivia and [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and Zs'Skayr's dialogue in ''[[Ghostfreaked Out]]'' corroborate that it is explicitly Zs'Skayr's merging with Ben, and benefiting from his DNA, that would have allowed him to "become whole" and surpass his vulnerability to sunlight.<ref name="GO"/>{{Refn|[[:File:Zs'Skayr Needs Ben's DNA.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="BAotD"/> It is inferred from this that the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] is ultimately what keeps Ghostfreak from being hurt by the sun.{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}}

Ghostfreak's tail is prehensile, as demonstrated by Zs'Skayr when he was in control of Ghostfreak's body.<ref name="GT" />

Ghostfreak has an eerie, glowing eye{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = card}} that can move around through the black lines on his body, which functionally gives him 360-degree vision.<ref name="Hunted" /> Additionally, like all [[Anur System]] aliens, Ghostfreak can see in the dark.{{Refn|[[:File:All Anur System Aliens Can See in the Dark.png]]|group = DJW}}

Ghostfreak is able to store small objects under his skin flaps, as demonstrated by Zs'Skayr.<ref name="CIS">''[[Charmed, I'm Sure]]''</ref>

Ghostfreak can alter his shape and deform like gas by making himself into a grey, somewhat transparent smoke-like wispy form.<ref name="Hunted" /><ref name="K11" /> While in this form, he is immune to being absorbed by [[Gutrot]]'s [[Gutrot's Species|species]].{{Refn|[[:File:Ghostfreak Gas Absorption Immunity.png]]|group = DJW}}

Although he never trained himself to do so, Ghostfreak may be able convert other species into Ectonurites, where then he is able to manipulate them into doing what he wants.<ref name="GT" />{{Refn|Zs'Skayr gained this ability sometime after the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Zs'Skayr GT Plumber Prison.png]]|group = DM}} It is unknown whether Ghostfreak, and by extension, other Ectonurites, can do this naturally.|group = note}}

===True Form===
Ghostfreak can project powerful energy beams from either his chest and or his hands whenever his skin is peeled back, as demonstrated by Zs'Skayr.<ref name="BAotD" /><ref name="GT" />

In his true form, Ghostfreak's telekinesis is greatly enhanced, being able to even move an entire pillar without effort.<ref name="GT" />

In his true form, while exposed to total darkness, like that of space, Ghostfreak's powers and abilities would be greatly enhanced to their full potential; this feat was also demonstrated with Zs'Skayr.<ref name="BAotD" />

Ghostfreak can rotate his skull,{{Refn|[[:File:Ectonurite Skull Rotation.png]]|group = DJW}} much like Zs'Skayr.<ref name="RMP" />

